<p class="kt-adv-heading7_86c8e8-6c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading vf-t-body vf-lh-normal vf-mt-1h" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading7_86c8e8-6c">For a simple contact form, often yes. For conditional logic, multi-step forms, file uploads or webhooks you will need a paid plan.</p>
